abstract: "1378 rows in six tables from the stock of Kitanesque (UK), each garment measured flat by hand before listing and each label read from the listing photographs: 108 pairs of jeans (label W size against waistband, rise and inside leg), 106 women's knitted pieces (UK size against bust, length and sleeve), 55 women's dresses (UK size against bust, waist and hips), the front rise and rise band of 112 pairs of jeans, the label facts of 439 pieces (country, fibre composition, care wording, printed sizes, RN/CA numbers with registrants) and every measurement of 558 garments in one table."
